      "principle": "The purpose behind Section 24 of the Act is to provide necessary financial assistance to a party with no independent income.",
      "held": "Indisputably, the purpose behind Section 24 of the Act of 1955 is to provide necessary financial assistance to the party to the matrimonial dispute who has no independent income of his own sufficient for her or his support or to bear the expenses of the proceedings.",
